  {
   "thing": {
    "kind": "text",
    "text": "THE ACCOUNT, ON A PANEL\n\nThe balance is a LIVE\nnumber. The old teller\nrobot is gone: depositing\nis a +badge to its bird,\nreading is [query | bird],\nwatching is [listen | bird].\n\nTwo rooms deposit at once.\nEach badge is applied whole\n-- no interleaving can tear\na deposit -- so 100, plus\nfive 10s, plus four 25s, is\n250 however the rounds\nhappen to land."
   },
   "x": -1.6,
   "z": 1.8
  },
  {
   "thing": {
    "kind": "text",
    "text": "TO RUN IT\n\nPull both levers.\n\nTenner banks +10 while its\nscale tips: five times.\nQuarter banks +25 four\ntimes. Each stops when its\nbeam comes level.\n\nThe statement nest keeps\nthe history, newest\nunderneath.\n\nA level beam is a robot\nSTOPPED -- its lever will\nsay so. To bank again, step\nin through the door and set\nthe left pan back to 1."
   },
   "x": 1.7,
